<title>USA: Rockwell wins $196 mln US defense contract.</title>
<headline>Rockwell wins $196 mln US defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rockwell International Corp was awarded a $196 million U.S. defense contract for up to 230 communications terminals for the military's Joint Tactical Information Distribution System, the Air Force said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
